<%# Starting template only. Have this reviewed by an attorney before launch. %>
<section class="plain-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)">Privacy Policy</h1></div></section>
<section class="section tight"><div class="wrap prose">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you request a trip or contact us we collect your name, email, phone number and the travel preferences you share with us.</p>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use your information to research and plan your trip, communicate with you and, once you approve, to make reservations with travel suppliers. We share only what a supplier needs to complete your booking.</p>
  <h2>Research tools</h2>
  <p>We use software tools, including AI assisted research, to help compare travel options. Your agent reviews all recommendations personally.</p>
  <h2>Payment information</h2>
  <p>We do not store card numbers on this website. Payments are handled through the supplier or a secure payment provider.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to update or delete your information at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:<%= brand.email %>"><%= brand.email %></a>.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site uses a necessary cookie to keep forms secure. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>
</div></section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
